a2=A.F("The Nigerian celebration was steeped in tradition. "+f+" and "+e+" wore custom-made attire. He danced in with her family behind him, knelt to ask her parents for permission to take her into his family, and brought a dowry filled with gifts.",b1,b1,b1,B.bG,b1,b1)
a3=A.F("\u201cThere was so much joy,\u201d "+f+" says. \u201cMoney spraying is a very common thing in Nigerian tradition \u2014 you just kind of spray [$1 bills] on each other. It was amazing.\u201d",b1,b1,b1,B.bG,b1,b1)
a4=A.F("Their Portugal ceremony was more intimate \u2014 just 45 guests gathered to watch them exchange vows overlooking the coast. \u201cIt was fun to have all of our favorite people together in Portugal to celebrate us in a different way as well,\u201d says "+f+".",b1,b1,b1,B.bG,b1,b1)
a5=A.F("What defines their relationship is a sense of partnership \u2014 the certainty that no matter what life brings, they can face it together. \u201cWhen one of us is having a bad day, the other one\u2019s probably picking up some of the slack. We\u2019re looking after each other because it\u2019s us against everything, as opposed to us against each other,\u201d "+f+" says.",b1,b1,b1,B.bG,b1,b1)
a6=A.F("By the time "+e+" came along, she finally felt ready for that kind of partnership. \u201cA lot of personal growth coming into 2020 helped me be energetically where I needed to be to meet someone like him,\u201d she says. \u201cI didn\u2019t like the idea of waiting for somebody to message me. I\u2019m in charge of my love life here, so I just really always felt empowered by Aviaj.\u201d",b1,b1,b1,B.bG,b1,b1)
a7=A.F("When asked what they admire about the other, "+f+" speaks to "+e+"\u2019s patience and kindness, qualities that steady her energy. She also says, \u201cHe\u2019s the kindest person you\u2019ll ever meet. He looks after everybody.\u201d",b1,b1,b1,B.bG,b1,b1)
a8=A.F(e+" calls "+f+" the \u201cperfect person,\u201d adding, \u201cIf I had to be a better person, I would model myself after my wife. The amount of empathy that she has for people, her ability to read situations, and give advice is unmatched. She\u2019s amazing.\u201d",b1,b1,b1,B.bG,b1,b1)
